<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0367_R26R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somethin’ written here.\nRead it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0367_R26R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">To my brothers and sisters:\rWe take pride in servin’ Hustlers.\rWhen Hustlers talk to you, give ’em\nsomethin’ useful. No freeloadin’.\fI’m lookin’ at you, Santos.\rLove, Monica\rKeep readin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0367_R26R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Monday, Monica\nRt. 40\rTuesday, Tuscany\nRt. 29\rWednesday, Wesley\nLake of Rage\rThursday, Arthur\nRt. 36\rFriday, Frieda\nRt. 32\rSaturday, Santos\nBlackthorn City\rSunday, Sunny\nRt. 37</language>
	</row>
</body>
